BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:We’re delighted to announce our collaboration with Mr Moody’s Tavern on
	 Saturday, 21 November!-1795273200
SUMMARY:We’re delighted to announce our collaboration with Mr Moody’s Taver
	n on Saturday\, 21 November!
DTSTAMP:20261022T105425Z
DTSTART:20261121T150000Z
DTEND:20261121T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:We’re delighted to announce our collaboration with Mr Moody’s T
	avern on Saturday\, 21 November!\n\nCome and join us for a Boozy afternoon
	 Tea\, food by us and cocktails and atmosphere created by Moody’s and the 
	lovely Rachel at Velvet Funk who will be DJing live for you. \n\nMolly has
	 created an amazing cocktail menu\, which you can check out on the second 
	slide. \n\nThis is a ticketed event priced at just £42 for two people shar
	ing. \n\nThe price includes:\n\n- A beautiful afternoon tea platter based 
	on two sharing!\n\n- A complimentary glass of Prosecco on arrival!\n\n- A 
	goodie bag for each of you by Liberty Natural Skincare!\n\nTo book contact
	 midweek@moodys on instagram or call Molly on 07902927183. \n\nCan’t wait 
	to see you there 💚
URL:https://www.instagram.com/p/DeeJXbXjQgD/
LOCATION:Mr Moody's Tavern\, 6 Newland Ave\, Hull HU5 3AF
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
