UID:THANK YOU to everyone, who joined us, for The Confessional Hull last ni
	ght, and our amazing hosts, Phill and Rebecca 🥰-1794355200
SUMMARY:THANK YOU to everyone\, who joined us\, for The Confessional Hull l
	ast night\, and our amazing hosts\, Phill and Rebecca 🥰
DTSTAMP:20261022T105425Z
DTSTART:20261111T000000Z
DTEND:20261111T020000Z
DESCRIPTION:THANK YOU to everyone\, who joined us\, for The Confessional Hu
	ll last night\, and our amazing hosts\, Phill and Rebecca 🥰\n\nAlthough\, 
	I wasn’t personally there this time myself\, (gutted to miss it) I hear\, 
	it was an evening\, of laughter and tears\, and exceptional\, as always \n
	\nThe Confessional\, is on the second Wednesday\, of every month\, so get 
	it in your diaries\, for the 11th of November\, if you would like to see w
	hat it’s all about\n\nWe look forward to seeing you! \n\nLovely Sue \n\n📸 
	Photo credit: Claire Bear (Thank you 🙏)\n\n___________________\nNewland Ta
	p\n135 Newland Avenue\nOpen 3pm - 11pm daily \nBYO food \nDrink our drinks
	\nDogs worshipped 🐾
URL:https://www.instagram.com/p/DegiaGfDUOg/
LOCATION:Newland Tap
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
